{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act9d0_level_act9d0_01_beg",
  "groupId": "act9d0",
  "stageId": "act9d0_01",
  "title": "Buried",
  "storyCode": "DM-1",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act9d0/level_act9d0_01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "aa27d695e53f79bfb871f806a4d14e33fed2bde595d14e163c182e4beb2014ad",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It's me.\nI've reached the target destination. I have visual confirmation of the smoke signal's coordinates.\n...It's been a while since our last fight with the other mercenaries. We've taken some losses.\nBut they hid plenty of supplies in the underground bunker. We won't come back empty-handed.\nMm, yeah. The scout can go on ahead.\nI'll catch up soon.\n...Right, there was an unexpected casualty.\nW is dead."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're talking like it was hell on earth out there, but you look perfectly fine to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Or are you talking it up to get a pity bonus?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, it's not like you had to go out of your way to leave camp to pick us up. Who asked you to be such a worrywart?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I don't give a shit about anyone. Quit projecting."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If W hadn't stayed behind to create an opening for us, none of us would've made it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...When did it happen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Two hours ago, when our communications were cut off. The squad got ambushed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "W blew apart the ruins and gave us a chance to escape. He fought until the bitter end."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Poor guy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yeah. If only he made it back to camp alive. His kill count was well past mine. He would've come out as top merc, easy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Forget it, no point talking about that stuff now. At least he's earned his rest."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "With the enemy routed, we should probably bring him back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Impossible. We can't risk exposing ourselves like that. Don't want to get caught out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why would you even want to? Were you two that close? Nobody told me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "He had a bunch of loot on him. That's all I care about."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It wasn't that much. Some of the other guys brought in bigger hauls."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "When the war ends, we can go back to the good old days."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...If the war ends."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hmph..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We can sit around and commiserate later. We'd better get out of here before sunset if we don't want to be the center of attention."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Head back to camp and muster the troops."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hmm—?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is that an order, 'Second' Lieutenant Hoederer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...We've lost contact with the other squads. As of right now, I'm your commanding officer."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We're the same rank."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*Sigh*...."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Ines, let's hurry back to the rendezvous point. Then we can contact the client again to renegotiate our deal."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's a suggestion, not an order. All right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hmph..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How much you think we can milk W's death for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "He was a helluva merc. Everybody knew."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "At least... his death won't be in vain."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "In the end, did he leave anything—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—Shh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Someone's coming. Three o'clock. Not one of ours."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just one. Get out."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A Sarkaz...? One of the natives?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, wait... You have W's gun and knife in your hands..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Who the hell are you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Not talking? Then, die."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wait, hold up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She followed us here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...You let her follow you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We haven't exactly been dragging our feet, but she's kept up with us purely through her own skills, even after grabbing W's gear."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She's an 'experienced' Sarkaz, and I may need a local guide when it's time to bounce."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—Are you insane? Isn't that all the more reason to kill her right here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you want us all dead, you might as well just do it yourself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I wouldn't dare."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What if she's an assassin? What if she leads us straight into a trap?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Did you forget how many people in Kazdel want your head?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh? How many?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...There's one right in front of you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You've got a huge bounty on your head. But for the time being, I'd rather it stay on your shoulders. Don't get too full of yourself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I appreciate your diligence and frugality, but I'm not joking around either."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She took the risk to pick up W's knife and gun, and had the stones to walk right up to us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What are your Arts telling you? Is she hostile?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...No sane person would just take in a totally unknown Sarkaz."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yeah, that's the difference between you and me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "On my way back, I gave her a whole bunch of openings, and she... threw little stones at me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "An interesting display of good will, wouldn't you agree?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "According to the old ways, we might want to give her a chance."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This war has thinned out our ranks. We could recruit some more Sarkaz, just as mysterious as her, but I'd rather hand-pick someone myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But, she's an outsider. Our ways don't apply to—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—You know what, forget it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm leaving in ten minutes. I don't care how many come with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But if you're gonna give me any more corpses to deal with, I don't care whose, you better make it quick."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Heh. Quite the impatient one, aren't you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...All right, you. Listen carefully."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're holding our fallen comrade's relics there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Put them down, and you can walk out of here alive. You'll have to find somewhere else to die, but at least you'll buy yourself some extra time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This is your last chance."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Last... chance?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...I don't think I ever had a choice. The second I turn around, you draw your blade and cut me down."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This whole time... your other hand has been on that hilt."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Very good."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You may have seen us before, or maybe you worked for someone else. None of that concerns me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But, you understand what it means to take up the weapons of the fallen, yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
